s-of-hyjal-reputation-boost","host":"expcarry.com","tier":3,"label":"forum or datamine","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S5","url":"https://conquestcapped.com/guides/wow-forever/wow-forever-mage-tier-set/","host":"conquestcapped.com","tier":3,"label":"forum or datamine","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"tailoring.artisans_tier.loom_source","value":"Blueprint: Loom drops from an unnamed dungeon boss","refs":[{"id":"S5","url":"https://conquestcapped.com/guides/wow-forever/wow-forever-mage-tier-set/","host":"conquestcapped.com","tier":3,"label":"forum or datamine","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]}],"open":["Which school each Favor line belongs to; stats for every Favor set piece.","Whether Handwraps, Shoulders and Cuffs share the Waistcord's 60 Favor and Friendly gate.","Fiery Sandals at skill 235 sit past the Expert cap, so on paper they wait for Artisan training at level 35.","The hidden-stats claim: item stats stay hidden until the item drops for someone on your realm (one site)."],"aliases":[],"blurb":"Tailoring has the deepest Favor vendor: six-piece school sets at level 12 for 30 Favor a piece, with Friendly and Honored upgrade lines for levels 35 to 50; every Favor piece binds on pickup.","related":["systems/merchants-favor","professions/overview","systems/camping-objects","systems/reputations","events/raids-dec-9"],"history":[{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"migrated from library topic 21"}],"recheck_days":14,"snapshots":[{"id":"S1","host":"wow-professions.com","tier":2,"sha8":"10ae2718","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S2","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"sha8":"73b4c918","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S3","host":"wow-professions.com","tier":2,"sha8":"dbf9cff4","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S4","host":"rankedboost.com","tier":3,"sha8":"fc608909","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S5","host":"conquestcapped.com","tier":3,"sha8":"cd443b8d","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S6","host":"conquestcapped.com","tier":3,"sha8":"d14273f9","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S7","hos